  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Establishing an Integrated Logistics Center to Improve  Agricultural Distribution and Regional Logistics in Kyrgyzstan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment and Operation of an Integrated Logistics Center, Development of a Logistics Center Operation and Management System, Establishment of Networks and Support Mechanisms for the Sustainable Operation of the Integrated Logistics Center, Development of a Logistics Workforce Training Program Implementation of Logistics Workforce Training</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to reduce losses across distribution processes, improve the profitability of farmers, intermediaries and local businesses and ultimately build a sustainable regional logistics ecosystem&#xb18d;&#xc0b0;&#xbb3c; &#xc720;&#xd1b5; &#xd6a8;&#xc728;&#xd654; &#xbc0f; &#xd488;&#xc9c8; &#xac1c;&#xc120;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xb18d;&#xc7a5;&#xacfc; &#xc911;&#xac04;&#xc0c1; &#xc218;&#xc775;&#xc131; &#xc81c;&#xace0;,  &#xbb3c;&#xb958; &#xc778;&#xb825; &#xc591;&#xc131;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xbcf5;&#xd569;&#xbb3c;&#xb958;&#xc13c;&#xd130; &#xc9c0;&#xc18d;&#xc6b4;&#xc601; &#xae30;&#xbc18; &#xd655;&#xbcf4;</narrative>
